  <name>MegaMek</name>
  <summary>Unofficial BattleTech tabletop game</summary>
  <developer id="org.megamek">
    <name>The MegaMek Team</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      MegaMek is a free, open source version of the BattleTech board game. Play alone against
      the computer, or with friends over the internet.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Play the Core Rules, with many optional rules from the advanced rulebooks</li>
      <li>Every unit type, from infantry and BattleMeks to aerospace fighters, DropShips and WarShips</li>
      <li>Ground battles and space battles</li>
      <li>Thousands of units ready to play, plus the units, maps and scenarios you make</li>
      <li>Computer opponents for solo play</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      MegaMek is made by volunteers. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the owners of the
      BattleTech trademarks.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.megamek.MegaMek.desktop</launchable>

  <url type="homepage">https://megamek.org</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/MegaMek/megamek/issues</url>
